;; The blue stone (4,8) under rock in the west wall, Cave Mouth's vestibule
;; behind it; a chalk hall with a stepped pipe rank, B's shaft (19-20) and
;; the drop to G (10-11) between the door and E.
(room
  region: pipes
  at: (1 5)
  title: "Chalk Door"
  intent: "a cold blue stone faces the black mouth of the glass caves, a way home seen before it opens"
  bed: (wind 0.1 water 0.2 pipes 0.5 drone 0.5)
  light: 0.33
  grid:
  ("##################%  %###"
   "##################%  %###"
   "########    ##  ##%  %###"
   "#######      #|  #%  %###"
   "######        |   %  %###"
